      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Communication Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n# Information Management Plan\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Governs how project data, records, documentation, and institutional knowledge are captured, stored, secured, and distributed.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Information Management Plan** ensures that all project information is readily accessible, version-controlled, secure, and retained in compliance with organizational and statutory requirements.\r\n\r\n## Structure\r\n- **Storage & Architecture**: Document repositories, cloud folders, access controls.\r\n- **Security & Privacy**: GDPR compliance, confidentiality tiers, data loss prevention.\r\n- **Retention & Archiving**: Record retention periods and end-of-project archiving protocols.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\nOperates alongside [[General Principles of Information Management]] and [[Knowledge Management]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Communication Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Information Management]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Manage Information]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Framework Master MOC]]\r\n- [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- [[Complexity]]\r\n"
