      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n Information Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> ",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Communication Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n# Information Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Capability maturity benchmarks and assessment criteria for organizational information management.\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nThis note defines the capability maturity benchmarks for the **Information Management** function across levels 1 to 5.\r\n\r\n## Maturity Benchmarks\r\n- **Level 1 (Initial)**: Ad-hoc file storage, inconsistent naming conventions, and scattered documentation.\r\n- **Level 2 (Managed)**: Structured [[Information Management Plan]] applied consistently; central document repositories established.\r\n- **Level 3 (Defined)**: Organization-wide document taxonomies, security tiers, and automated version control.\r\n- **Level 4 (Quantitatively Managed)**: Metrics on information retrieval time, compliance audits, and data accuracy.\r\n- **Level 5 (Optimizing)**: Continuous optimization through semantic search, automated record management, and AI indexing.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\nConnects to [[General Principles of Information Management]], [[Information Management Plan]], and [[Capability Maturity]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Communication Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[General Principles of Information Management]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Information Management Plan]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Framework Master MOC]]\r\n- [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- [[Complexity]]\r\n"
