      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Knowledge | **Section**: `Cost Management`\r\n\r\n# Cost Management\r\n\r\n> [!ABSTRACT] Section Overview\r\n> Comprehensive guide to Cost Management covering principles, management plans, registers, competencies, and capability maturity.\r\n\r\n## Notes in this Section (5)\r\n\r\n| Note | Type | Description |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| [[Budgeting and cost control]] | `Concept` | - **Definition**: Budgeting and cost control includes the detailed estimation of costs, the setting of agreed budgets, a |\r\n| [[Develop Budgets And Control Costs]] | `Competency` | Demonstrates the capability to estimate expenditures, build time-phased cost baselines, and control project finances. |\r\n| [[Finance Management]] | `Management-area` | - The function of Financial Management should: |\r\n| [[Financial Management]] | `Maturity` | Capability maturity attributes and benchmarks for organizational financial management. |\r\n| [[General Principles of Financial Management]] | `Management-area` | - **Definition**: Financial management covers all aspects of obtaining, deploying, and controlling the financial resourc | ---\r\n## Cross-Pillar Relationships\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Return to Master MOC]]\r\n- [[03. Processes/00 - Overview|Life Cycle Processes]]\r\n- [[06. Documentation & Artefacts/00 - Overview|Artefacts & Documentation]]\r\n- [[05. Competencies & Skills/00 - Overview|Competencies & Skills]]\r\n- [[09. Maturity Models/00 - Overview|Capability Maturity]]\r\n"
