      "subarea": "Capability",
      "type": "maturity",
      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n Financial Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Financial Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n# Financial Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Capability maturity attributes and benchmarks for organizational financial management.\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nDefines the organizational capability benchmarks for **Financial Management** and cost control.\r\n\r\n## Maturity Levels\r\n- **Level 1**: Basic accounting without formal project cost baselining; frequent budget surprises.\r\n- **Level 2**: Standardized [[Finance Management Plan]], cost breakdown structures, and periodic variance tracking.\r\n- **Level 3**: Enterprise-wide financial integration, standardized estimating models, and formal cash flow modeling.\r\n- **Level 4**: Statistical analysis of cost performance, Earned Value analysis, and probabilistic risk contingency modeling.\r\n- **Level 5**: Continuous financial process refinement, value engineering, and strategic capital optimization.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\nSee [[General Principles of Financial Management]], [[Finance Management Plan]], and [[Budgeting and cost control]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Financial Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Finance Management]]\r\n- **Next**: [[General Principles of Financial Management]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Framework Master MOC]]\r\n- [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- [[Complexity]]\r\n"
