      "folder": "04. Management Areas/Risk Management",
      "title": "Risk Management Maturity",
      "pillar": "Capability Maturity",
      "section": "Risk Management",
      "subarea": "Capability",
      "type": "maturity",
      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n Risk Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMA",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Risk Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n# Risk Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Organizational capability maturity benchmarks for proactive risk management.\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nBenchmarks the maturity of an organization's risk management practices.\r\n\r\n## Maturity Stages\r\n- **Level 1**: Risks identified reactively after they occur; lack of formal register.\r\n- **Level 2**: Structured [[Risk Management Plan]] and [[Risk Register]] used on all major initiatives.\r\n- **Level 3**: Standardized organizational risk taxonomy, probability/impact guidelines, and risk ownership culture.\r\n- **Level 4**: Quantitative Monte Carlo simulations, schedule/cost risk integration, and risk-adjusted portfolios.\r\n- **Level 5**: Agile risk responses, proactive opportunity exploitation, and strategic resilience engineering.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\nSee [[General Principles of Risk Management]], [[Risk Management Capability Maturity]], and [[Risk Register]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Risk Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Manage Risk]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Risk Management Capability Maturity]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Risk Management Plan]]\r\n- [[Risk Register]]\r\n- [[Manage Risk Competency|Manage Risk]]\r\n- [[Delivery Process]]\r\n"
