      "type": "competency",
      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Competence | **Type**: `competency`\r\n\r\n Manage The Schedule Competency\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMAR",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Schedule Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Competence | **Type**: `competency`\r\n\r\n# Manage The Schedule Competency\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Demonstrates the capability to plan, develop, optimize, and control project time schedules.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Manage The Schedule** competency certifies an individual's ability to sequence activities, estimate durations, construct network diagrams, and track time performance.\r\n\r\n## Performance Criteria\r\n1. Define activities and dependencies using Work and Product Breakdown Structures.\r\n2. Estimate activity durations and apply resource constraints.\r\n3. Calculate Critical Path, floats, and milestones.\r\n4. Baseline the schedule and track actuals vs. planned progress.\r\n5. Take corrective action when schedules deviate beyond tolerances.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Schedule Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[General Principles of Schedule Management]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Schedule Management]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Schedule Management Plan]]\r\n- [[Time Scheduling]]\r\n- [[Delivery Plan]]\r\n- [[Manage The Schedule Competency|Manage The Schedule]]\r\n"
