      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Stakeholder Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Competence | **Type**: `competency`\r\n\r\n# Manage Stakeholders Competency\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Demonstrates the capability to identify stakeholders, analyze interests and influence, and execute engagement plans.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Manage Stakeholders** competency demonstrates the ability to identify, analyze, and build productive relationships with all individuals and groups affected by the project.\r\n\r\n## Performance Criteria\r\n1. Identify all direct and indirect stakeholders.\r\n2. Assess stakeholder power, interest, and potential impact.\r\n3. Author the [[Stakeholder Management Plan]] and [[Stakeholder Register]].\r\n4. Execute proactive engagement and measure shifts in stakeholder support.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Stakeholder Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[General Principles of Stakeholder Management]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Stakeholder Management]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Stakeholder Management Plan]]\r\n- [[Stakeholder Register]]\r\n- [[Communication Plan]]\r\n- [[Manage Stakeholders Competency|Manage Stakeholders]]\r\n"
