      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Stakeholder Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n# Stakeholder Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Maturity benchmarks for identifying, analyzing, and engaging stakeholders.\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nAssesses an organization's capability to manage relationships with stakeholders.\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\n- **Level 1**: Ad-hoc communication; stakeholders managed only when issues arise.\r\n- **Level 2**: Systematic stakeholder identification, [[Stakeholder Register]], and [[Communication Plan]].\r\n- **Level 3**: Consistent stakeholder engagement frameworks embedded across all projects and programmes.\r\n- **Level 4**: Quantitative feedback metrics, sentiment tracking, and engagement effectiveness scoring.\r\n- **Level 5**: Proactive co-creation, collaborative governance, and continuous communication optimization.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\nSee [[General Principles of Stakeholder Management]], [[Stakeholder Management Plan]], and [[Manage Stakeholders]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Stakeholder Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Manage Stakeholders]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Stakeholder Management Plan]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Stakeholder Management Plan]]\r\n- [[Stakeholder Register]]\r\n- [[Communication Plan]]\r\n- [[Manage Stakeholders Competency|Manage Stakeholders]]\r\n"
