      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Stakeholder Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n# Stakeholder Register\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> The Stakeholder Register documents all stakeholders, their interests, influence levels, and tailored engagement approaches.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Stakeholder Register** is the primary repository for recording stakeholder attributes, expectations, influence, and strategic engagement plans.\r\n\r\n## Key Fields\r\n- **Stakeholder Name & Role**: Internal or external group/individual.\r\n- **Interest Area**: What they care about (outputs, benefits, disruption, financial return).\r\n- **Influence / Power Level**: High, medium, or low ability to affect project outcomes.\r\n- **Current Attitude**: Supportive, neutral, opposed, or unaware.\r\n- **Target Attitude**: Desired stance required for project success.\r\n- **Key Concerns & Expectations**: Specific needs or perceived risks.\r\n- **Primary Communication Channel**: Preferred frequency and medium (email, workshop, 1-on-1).\r\n- **Relationship Lead**: Assigned team member responsible for maintaining contact.\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n- Created in the [[Identification Process]] / [[Definition Process]].\r\n- Actively consulted when issuing [[Progress Report]]s or planning stage transitions.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Stakeholder Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Stakeholder Management Plan]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Stakeholder Management Plan]]\r\n- [[Stakeholder Register]]\r\n- [[Communication Plan]]\r\n- [[Manage Stakeholders Competency|Manage Stakeholders]]\r\n"
