      "type": "artefact",
      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n Definition Plan\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> A deli",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Delivery Documents]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n# Definition Plan\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> A delivery plan created in the identification process describing how the definition phase will be conducted, resourced, and governed.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Definition Plan** sets out the scope, schedule, budget, and resources required to carry out the [[Definition Process]]. It ensures that defining the project is treated with disciplined planning rather than an uncoordinated preliminary effort.\r\n\r\n## Key Contents\r\n- **Scope of Definition**: What investigations, feasibility studies, architectures, and business cases need to be produced.\r\n- **Schedule**: Timeline for producing all management plans and the business case.\r\n- **Budget**: Funds required to run the definition phase (consultants, workshops, software trials).\r\n- **Resources**: Assigned team members and specialist contributors.\r\n- **Acceptance Criteria**: Criteria to determine whether the definition phase is complete.\r\n\r\n## Timing\r\n- Prepared in the [[Identification Process]] alongside the [[Brief]].\r\n- Approved by the Sponsor to authorize entry into the [[Definition Process]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Delivery Documents Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Daily Log]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Delivery Documents]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Identification Process]]\r\n- [[Definition Process]]\r\n- [[Delivery Process]]\r\n- [[Closure Process]]\r\n"
