      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n Follow-on Actions Report\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Delivery Documents]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n# Follow-on Actions Report\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Documents unresolved issues, ongoing maintenance responsibilities, and residual risks transferred to operational teams upon closure.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Follow-on Actions Report** lists all outstanding actions, unresolved minor issues, operational recommendations, and ongoing risks when the project or programme team is demobilized during the [[Closure Process]].\r\n\r\n## Key Contents\r\n- **Handover Items**: Operational manuals, warranty terms, and service agreements.\r\n- **Outstanding Deliverables**: Minor defects or secondary enhancements deferred to operational maintenance.\r\n- **Residual Risks**: Threats and opportunities transferred to permanent departmental risk registers.\r\n- **Assigned Stewardship**: Named operational owners for every outstanding action.\r\n\r\n## Timing\r\nAuthored during the [[Closure Process]] and accepted by the Sponsor and operations leads before formal disbandment.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Delivery Documents Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Finance Management Plan]]\r\n- **Next**: [[General Principles of Configuration Management]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Identification Process]]\r\n- [[Definition Process]]\r\n- [[Delivery Process]]\r\n- [[Closure Process]]\r\n"
