      "subarea": "Capability",
      "type": "maturity",
      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n Requirements Management Maturity\r\n\r\n>",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Scope Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n# Requirements Management Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Capability maturity benchmarks for eliciting, structuring, and baselining scope requirements.\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nCapability maturity benchmarks for **Requirements Management**.\r\n\r\n## Levels\r\n- **Level 1**: Poorly documented requirements; frequent scope disputes during testing.\r\n- **Level 2**: Structured elicitation, MoSCoW prioritization, and documented acceptance criteria.\r\n- **Level 3**: End-to-end requirement traceability matrices and standardized validation protocols.\r\n- **Level 4**: Defect density analysis, requirement volatility metrics, and quantitative verification.\r\n- **Level 5**: Continuous customer feedback integration and automated requirement validation.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\nConnects to [[General Principles of Requirements Management]], [[Manage Requirements]], and [[Scope Management]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Scope Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Progress Report]]\r\n- **Next**: [[Support]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Framework Master MOC]]\r\n- [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- [[Complexity]]\r\n"
