      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n Vision Statement\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> A con",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Scope Documents]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n# Vision Statement\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> A concise, inspirational declaration of the future state that the project or programme aims to deliver.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Vision Statement** encapsulates the ultimate purpose and transformational ambition of a project or programme. It serves as an emotional and strategic anchor for leaders, teams, and stakeholders.\r\n\r\n## Characteristics\r\n- **Clarity**: Unambiguous description of the target operational state.\r\n- **Inspirational**: Motivates stakeholders to navigate complex organizational change.\r\n- **Strategic Alignment**: Directly connects project outputs to enterprise strategy.\r\n\r\n## Timing\r\nAuthored during the [[Identification Process]] by the Sponsor and senior leaders.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Scope Documents Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Sustainability]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Framework Master MOC]]\r\n- [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- [[Complexity]]\r\n"
