      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Competence | **Type**: `competency`\r\n\r\n Work Within A Team\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Interpersonal Competencies]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Competence | **Type**: `competency`\r\n\r\n# Work Within A Team\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Demonstrates the ability to collaborate effectively, communicate openly, and contribute productively as a member of a multidisciplinary team.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Work Within A Team** competency describes the attitudes and actions required of team members to build cohesion, share accountability, and deliver collective commitments.\r\n\r\n## Performance Criteria\r\n1. Understand and fulfill assigned roles and responsibilities within the team.\r\n2. Share information, insights, and risks openly with peers and managers.\r\n3. Support colleagues and resolve minor conflicts constructively.\r\n4. Adhere to agreed team norms, working standards, and quality criteria.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Interpersonal Competencies Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[What does Control Mean]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Framework Master MOC]]\r\n- [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- [[Complexity]]\r\n"
