      "type": "artefact",
      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n Change Log\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> The Change ",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Delivery Documents]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Method | **Type**: `artefact`\r\n\r\n# Change Log\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> The Change Log records all formal requests for changes to scope and baselined products, tracking them through change control.\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nThe **Change Log** tracks all change requests submitted against approved baselines (scope, schedule, budget, or specifications). It prevents scope creep and ensures every modification is evaluated for impact, cost, and alignment.\r\n\r\n## Key Information\r\n- **Change Request ID**: Unique tracker.\r\n- **Date Submitted & Originator**: Stakeholder or team member requesting the change.\r\n- **Description of Change**: Proposed alteration to baseline deliverables.\r\n- **Business Justification**: Reason (regulatory, efficiency, defect fix, scope expansion).\r\n- **Impact Assessment**: Consequences on schedule, cost, risk, and dependencies.\r\n- **Change Authority Decision**: Approved, Rejected, Deferred, or Escalated.\r\n- **Implementation Status**: Pending, In Progress, Completed, Verified.\r\n\r\n## Governance\r\nOperated in accordance with the [[Control Scope Change]] procedure and [[General Principles of Configuration Management]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Delivery Documents Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- **Next**: [[General Principles of Capability Maturity]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[Identification Process]]\r\n- [[Definition Process]]\r\n- [[Delivery Process]]\r\n- [[Closure Process]]\r\n"
