      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Knowledge | **Section**: `Investment & Benefits`\r\n\r\n# Investment & Benefits\r\n\r\n> [!ABSTRACT] Section Overview\r\n> Financial appraisal, capital funding mechanisms, business case viability, and benefit realization.\r\n\r\n## Notes in this Section (9)\r\n\r\n| Note | Type | Description |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| [[Comprehensive Study Notes Manage Risk Competency]] | `Competency` | - The purpose of this competency is to demonstrate the ability to achieve the goals of risk management. These goals are  |\r\n| [[Develop Investment Appraisal]] | `Competency` | Demonstrates the capability to evaluate capital investments using financial appraisal techniques like NPV, IRR, and payb |\r\n| [[Funding]] | `Maturity` | Organizational capability maturity benchmarks for securing and managing capital and operational funding. |\r\n| [[General Principles of Funding]] | `Guide` | - **Definition**: Funding is the means by which the finance required to undertake a project, programme, or portfolio is  |\r\n| [[Investment Appraisal]] | `Concept` | - **Definition**: Investment appraisal is a collection of techniques used to identify the financial and non-financial at |\r\n| [[Manage Benefits]] | `Competency` | Demonstrates the capability to identify, define, map, and track the realization of business benefits resulting from proj |\r\n| [[Manage Funding]] | `Competency` | Demonstrates the capability to secure, release, and reconcile capital and operational funding across stage gateways. |\r\n| [[Procurement Overall Goal]] | `Concept` | The overarching strategic and operational goals of the procurement function. |\r\n| [[Realise Benefits]] | `Competency` | Demonstrates the capability to transition outputs into operations and monitor post-implementation benefit realisation. | ---\r\n## Cross-Pillar Relationships\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Return to Master MOC]]\r\n- [[03. Processes/00 - Overview|Life Cycle Processes]]\r\n- [[06. Documentation & Artefacts/00 - Overview|Artefacts & Documentation]]\r\n- [[05. Competencies & Skills/00 - Overview|Competencies & Skills]]\r\n- [[09. Maturity Models/00 - Overview|Capability Maturity]]\r\n"
