      "summary": "> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**:  > **Section**: \r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n Funding Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Over",
      "body": "\r\n> [!NAV] Navigation\r\n> **Vault**: [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Overview]] > **Section**: [[00 - Overview|Financial Management]]\r\n> **Pillar**: Capability Maturity | **Type**: `maturity`\r\n\r\n# Funding Maturity\r\n\r\n> [!SUMMARY] Overview\r\n> Organizational capability maturity benchmarks for securing and managing capital and operational funding.\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nDefines the organizational maturity benchmarks for securing and managing project funding.\r\n\r\n## Maturity Benchmarks\r\n- **Level 1**: Chaotic or unpredictable funding releases; work stalls due to cash flow interruptions.\r\n- **Level 2**: Formal funding draw-downs aligned with approved stage gates and delivery plans.\r\n- **Level 3**: Enterprise capital allocation frameworks and multi-year funding portfolios.\r\n- **Level 4**: Real-time cash flow optimization and liquidity modeling across all portfolio components.\r\n- **Level 5**: Dynamic funding reallocation adapting immediately to market opportunities.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\nSee [[General Principles of Funding]], [[Manage Funding]], and [[Financial Management]].\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Navigation & Related Notes\r\n- **Up**: [[00 - Overview|Financial Management Overview]]\r\n- **Previous**: [[Develop Investment Appraisal]]\r\n- **Next**: [[General Principles of Funding]]\r\n\r\n### Related Concepts & Artefacts\r\n- [[00 - Praxis Framework Overview|Praxis Framework Master MOC]]\r\n- [[Capability Maturity]]\r\n- [[Complexity]]\r\n"
